Package: linux-image-orion-o6
Architecture: all
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Provides: linux-image,
          cix-csidma-driver,
Depends: radxa-overlays-dkms,
         linux-image-${binary:Version}-sky1,
         sky1-coresight-acpi,
         ${misc:Depends},
Description: Radxa Linux meta-package for Orion O6
 This is the meta-package for Linux kernel.

Package: sky1-coresight-acpi
Architecture: all
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Depends: cpio,
         initramfs-tools,
         ${misc:Depends},
Description: CoreSight SSDT prepended to initramfs for CIX SKY1 (Orion O6)
 Ships an ACPI SSDT (coresight.aml) that declares ETE/funnel/TMC nodes
 missing from the firmware ACPI tables, plus a /etc/initramfs/post-update.d
 hook that prepends a CPIO override to each new initrd image so the kernel
 picks it up via CONFIG_ACPI_TABLE_UPGRADE before acpi_init().

